    "Details could not refresh. Showing the last observation. %@": {
      "comment": "SeedHop macOS UI (TorrentDiagnosticsView.swift). Preserve placeholder types and positions; use positional placeholders when reordering. Text arguments may be verbatim user names, paths, or formatted quantities.",
